<tr><td>Vehicle</td><td>Chassis, year, engine, VIN-specific system and installed ECU</td><td>“Works with BMW”</td></tr>
<tr><td>Trigger</td><td>Repair completed, warning observed, or guided test instruction</td><td>Perform reset before diagnosis</td></tr>
